00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.193
- [Interviewer] All right, Beaver.

00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:21.026
- [Beaver] Yeah.

00:00:21.026 --> 00:00:22.857
- [Interviewer] Beaver,
tell me where you grew up?

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:24.154
